   "equation": "FE static, limit cases L1, L4 (side = max(mu_pad F_corner, C5 side load), both senses), L5, G2 (both senses, n_h m g at the tube end), H2c (T_lim along the 7 deg canted shaft at the prop centre + Q about the shaft, 4 sign combinations); envelope over upper/lower quarter and LE fillet intact / cracked between the boss and the collar; ultimate = sf x limit (joints x fit x prt); face = Q_f (eps0 + z kappa); collar torque = jump of the tube torque across the collar band; strip-to-paper shear flow per face q = |dN|/2/ds + |V|/d (foot-shoe nodes excluded), tau = q/w vs kd tau_board; strip end force per face = |N0|/2 + |M0|/d; pin force = q jf pitch; brace Pcr = pi^2 E w t^3 / (12 L^2); brace-end bond tau = F / (2 (w + t) engage); ear root s = 6 F (ear/2) / (w_ear h^2) + F / (w_ear h); collar bond tau = T / (2 pi r^2 h) + F / (pi d h), h_req at MS 0; anchor tau = F / (len_y pi d_spar / 4) vs peel x bond allowable",
