   "function": "block",
   "equation": "M = max(C1 design, m_task sf fit prt); F = f_ult fit prt ; tube bore: s = 6M/(d h^2) + F/(d h); shear-out tau = (1.5 M / h)/(e h), e = (W - d)/2 ; spar bore: s = 6M/(d W^2) + F/(d W); web (W x h): s = 6M/(W h^2), tau = M/(0.21 W h^2) ; bond torsion tau = 2 My sf fit prt/(pi d^2 W); bond axial tau = F/(pi d h)",
