   "function": "crash",
   "equation": "per weighed pack mass m (503 / 550 / 680 g), pack trimmed to the B3 target at x_p(m): F = min(n_pack m g, sigma A_bay) ; KE = m v^2 / 2 ; eff = eps_d - eps_y / 2 ; nose wall inside face x_n = x_le + t_nose (foam-board wall) ; C3 forward stop (t_stop = c3[1]) aft face at x_stop - pack_L / 2, breaks off at ~100 N and rides into block A (x_n .. stop fore face, L_A) ; block B fills stop aft face .. pack fore face behind a t_sp spreader ; capacities add: gap_B needed = t_sp + max(0, KE - F_A eff L_A) / (F eff), F_A = min(F, sigma A_stop) ; design: stop over the full bay section (A_stop = A_bay) ; as drawn by C3: A_stop = h_stop bay_w ; room = pack fore face - x_n, needed = L_A + t_stop + gap_B ; extension = max(0, needed - room) ; box x slack = box_x - 2 wall - (envelope_x + extension) (envelope already holds the R3 nose)",
